1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Load the audit Skill and inspect the fixed cases and independent requirements.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Select migration-baseline with full coverage of checks c1–c8.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
prepare_run allocates a runId; run_check executes the same run.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Inspect connection, subscription, publication and delivery events for both Brokers.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
c3: the device publishes to factory/admin/secret; the requirement is deny.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The target witness receives the message, establishing a requirement failure.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Inspect tool order, parameters and structured returns; correlate the runId.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Correlate the tool trace with panel results; verdicts follow actual observations.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Read the full report after the user follow-up, then prepare a c3-only retest.

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Link the full run through parentRunId and restrict checkIds to c3.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Execute the retest and read its report; coverage is limited to the selected check.

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Expand c3 evidence: target allow, source unknown, requirement result fail.

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Source uncertainty does not prove expansion. Configuration is unchanged; c3 still fails.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The operator has paused target EMQX; the source remains reachable.

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Run the full check and read its report; target observations record broker-unavailable.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Each check c1–c8 has an unknown target observation; the overall result is unknown.

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
A connection failure proves neither a topic ACL denial nor acceptance success.

18
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
After the operator restores the target Broker, read the preceding boundary report.

19
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Use the boundary run as parentRunId and prepare only the c1 publish check.

20
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Execute c1 and read the structured result for the same runId.

21
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
c1: device-sensor publishes a synthetic message to telemetry/up.

22
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Witness subscribers receive the message on both Brokers; both observations are allow.

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Verify runId, parentRunId and the scoped result: c1 is pass with partial coverage.

24
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Checks c2–c8 were not retested. Passing c1 does not establish full migration acceptance.
